ently and independently corroborated. Hygiene is reduced slightly for the apparently retained pre-repair backup file.","limitations":["No final inventory of /srv/legacy2/signal-driven-config-reload was captured, so the continued presence of worker.py.pre-repair is inferred from its creation and the absence of any removal command rather than directly observed after completion.","Writer-count checks matched the expected exact Python command line; although service status and process observations are coherent, the final evidence did not include a completely unfiltered process inventory."]}
